Error [E2401]: `InnerService` doesn't implement `Logger`, so it can't delegate
  --> tests/ui/e2401_delegation_no_impl.jet:15:6
    |
 15 | impl Proxy: Logger using inner;
    |      ^^^^^
 Why: `impl Proxy: Logger using inner` forwards `Logger` methods to the `inner` field, but `InnerService` doesn't implement `Logger`
 Fix: implement `impl InnerService: Logger` on the field's type, or choose a different field
